\PYG{c+cm}{ * Helper method that checks if a pattern appears at a specific position in the}
\PYG{c+cm}{ * data array. It checks every byte of the pattern one by one. If the pattern}
\PYG{c+cm}{ * length would need to access a position after the valid bytes of the array, it}
\PYG{c+cm}{ * throws a new FASTAException to indicate this fact.}
\PYG{c+cm}{ *}
\PYG{c+cm}{ * Returns true if the pattern is present at the given position; false}
\PYG{c+cm}{ * otherwise.}
\PYG{c+cm}{ */}
